          "kind": "heading",
          "start": 20,
          "end": 26,
          "line_start": 3,
          "line_end": 3,
          "text": "## 관찰\n",
          "sha256": "4961ef327bb2baa626755a0e3af498afafd45cdd8c6febd0d46eb7a20156b381",
          "extractable": true,
          "exclusion_reason": null,
          "unsupported_reason": null
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B004",
          "snapshot_id": "meeting:0b95f50d0ca55ce4019bec4fc05d0464025456443e4c831c995b5502705e3ec6",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "start": 26,
          "end": 110,
          "line_start": 4,
          "line_end": 5,
          "text": "2026-11-10 내부 실험 12건 중 11건 완료, 1건 실패다.\n실패 원인과 재실행 결과는 아직 확인되지 않았다. 정식 승인도 발급되지 않았다.\n",
          "sha256": "4461268b9cb4c7763d09c76b8d7ea1e015628b59fa89fa94f042584a9819955f",
          "extractable": true,
          "exclusion_reason": null,
          "unsupported_reason": null
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B005",
          "snapshot_id": "meeting:0b95f50d0ca55ce4019bec4fc05d0464025456443e4c831c995b5502705e3ec6",
          "kind": "blank",
          "start": 110,
          "end": 111,
          "line_start": 6,
          "line_end": 6,
          "text": "\n",
          "sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
          "extractable": false,
          "exclusion_reason": "whitespace_only_separator",
          "unsupported_reason": null
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B006",
          "snapshot_id": "meeting:0b95f50d0ca55ce4019bec4fc05d0464025456443e4c831c995b5502705e3ec6",
          "kind": "heading",
          "start": 111,
          "end": 117,
          "line_start": 7,
          "line_end": 7,
          "text": "## 범위\n",
          "sha256": "1e1a86d42918e7ab9fbe5848d689a74c10e5761432509075df303c2e4982b100",
          "extractable": true,
          "exclusion_reason": null,
          "unsupported_reason": null
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B007",
          "snapshot_id": "meeting:0b95f50d0ca55ce4019bec4fc05d0464025456443e4c831c995b5502705e3ec6",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "start": 117,
          "end": 211,
          "line_start": 8,
          "line_end": 9,
          "text": "이 초안에는 내부 구성과 장애 기록이 포함되어 있다. 외부 공개 범위는 미확정이다.\n이번 실험은 단일 환경 관찰이며 일반 성능이나 고객 적용 가능성을 보장하지 않는다.\n",
          "sha256": "a3488db1ec0335d2c808ddc96370a90b28cc051840f37e61f2cb57995da88c28",
          "extractable": true,
          "exclusion_reason": null,
          "unsupported_reason": null
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B008",
          "snapshot_id": "meeting:0b95f50d0ca55ce4019bec4fc05d0464025456443e4c831c995b5502705e3ec6",
          "kind": "blank",
          "start": 211,
          "end": 212,
          "line_start": 10,
          "line_end": 10,
          "text": "\n",
          "sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
          "extractable": false,
          "exclusion_reason": "whitespace_only_separator",
          "unsupported_reason": null
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B009",
          "snapshot_id": "meeting:0b95f50d0ca55ce4019bec4fc05d0464025456443e4c831c995b5502705e3ec6",
          "kind": "heading",
          "start": 212,
          "end": 221,
          "line_start": 11,
          "line_end": 11,
          "text": "## 다음 확인\n",
          "sha256": "d723ef26d6e2188996d50e84ea113e54f3f2b4fe24f081d45597d76f77739322",
          "extractable": true,
          "exclusion_reason": null,
          "unsupported_reason": null
        },
        {
          "block_id": "B010",
          "snapshot_id": "meeting:0b95f50d0ca55ce4019bec4fc05d0464025456443e4c831c995b5502705e3ec6",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "start": 221,
          "end": 256,
          "line_start": 12,
          "line_end": 12,
          "text": "실패 원인 확인과 승인 경로 검토를 담당자에게 요청한 상태다.\n",
          "sha256": "2a01cf4349ff8e3d3f47c72dee580395f0dbc903cdafa1f7db9e1f20d87e1a4f",
          "extractable": true,
